h2 About Us
.content
  .row.center
    .wide-column
      include blocks/paragraph_about
  .row
    .profiles
      .profile
        img.profile_image(src='/assets/images/about-us/paul.jpg' style=' width: 100%; height: auto;' alt='Selfie of Paul with his two doggos in the car')
        hr
        h3
          | Paul Brzeski
        p
          | Paul is a writer, creative technologist and co-founder of Open Studios. With two decades of experience in IT and digital media, he brings storytelling, software and visual experimentation together through games, fiction and interactive experiences.
        p
          | His work at the studio spans worldbuilding, 3D development and custom production tools. He enjoys exploring how things work and sharing what he learns through open-source projects, practical guides and reflections on the creative process.
        hr
        p
          a(href='https://github.com/paulbrzeski') Github
          |&nbsp;|&nbsp;
          a(href='https://linkedin.com/in/paul-b-23620b209/') LinkedIn
      .profile
        img.profile_image(src='/assets/images/about-us/garrett.png' style=' width: 100%; height: auto;' alt='Photo of Garrett studying a whisky blend at a distillery in Scotland')
        hr
        h3
          | Garrett Kinder
        p
          | Garrett is a Perth-based 3D artist and co-founder of Open Studios. Combining his passion for art and gaming, he creates 3D assets to help other developers bring their ideas to life.
        p
          | He produces assets under his label Obsidian Arts and works freelance alongside his husband Paul. Alongside developing his own asset collections, he welcomes enquiries for custom models and artwork for games and other creative projects.
        br
        hr
        p
          a(href='https://www.artstation.com/garrett_kinder') ArtStation
          |&nbsp;|&nbsp;
          a(href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/garrett-ray-kinder-361ba6a5/') LinkedIn

  .row.center
    .wide-column
      h3 Our values
  .row.center
    .feature
      .feature_media
        img(src='/assets/images/about-us/aboriginal-flag.png' alt='The Australian Aboriginal Flag')
      .feature_content
        p Open Studios acknowledges the Nyoongar Whadjuk people - traditional custodians of this land. We wish to acknowledge the strength of their continuing culture and pay our respects to Elders past and present.
  .row.center
    .feature
      .feature_content
        p Free and Open Source software is as much a way of thinking as it is a licensing scheme, as such we strive to be accountable, transparent, informative and useful to others in all business interactions and activities.
      .feature_media
        img(src='/assets/images/about-us/linux.png' alt='Collage of Open Source project logos')
  .row.center
    .feature
      .feature_media
        img(src='/assets/images/about-us/newpride.png' alt='2018 Progress Pride Flag by Daniel Quasar')
      .feature_content
        p We embrace differences, cherishing the rich tapestry of backgrounds, experiences, and identities that each person brings. It is important to us that working relationships are not only productive but also built on a foundation of mutual respect and appreciation.
